<title>USA: IMM currency futures higher in late trading.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures higher in late trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 18 - IMM currency futures were higher in late trading, as the dollar sagged below 116 yen and 1.80 marks heading into the weekend. Traders say currencies buoyant amid weak stocks, bonds, though most currency ranges still rather tight.</p>
<p>((Chicago Derivatives Desk (312)408-8750))</p>
